{"code":"080470","name":"성창오토텍","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1996년 자동차부품의 개발 및 제조를 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2006년 코스닥시장에 상장한 주권상장법인임. 미국 SCA Inc.와 중국 염성고산기차배건유한공사를 연결대상 종속회사로 보유하고 있음. 국내에서는 Cabin Filter, Inverter, 전장부품 등 자동차 공조용 부품 및 전기전장부품을 생산하고, 해외에서는 HVAC, 카울탑커버, 휠가드 등 자동차용 사출부품을 생산하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":2590.0,"open":2610.0,"high":2700.0,"low":2355.0,"volume":7072,"amount":18316480.0,"ret_1d":-5.4745,"gap":-4.7445,"range_pct":13.3205,"ret_5":-6.1594,"ret_20":-4.9541,"ret_60":-3.7175,"ret_120":-39.627,"ret_250":-41.2698,"ma20":2745.25,"ma60":2817.6667,"ma120":3006.25,"ma200":3490.1,"close_vs_ma200":-25.7901,"close_vs_ma60":-8.08,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-30.3019,"r2_60":0.5071,"slope_120":-46.1319,"r2_120":0.5591,"slope_250":-42.513,"r2_250":0.7429,"high52":4785.0,"low52":2355.0,"pos_52w":9.6708,"dd_52w":-45.8725,"mdd_1y":-44.8349,"atr14_pct":9.4181,"vol_ann_60":44.8889,"vol_avg20":6747.95,"vol_ratio20":1.048,"vr5":0.6911,"vr20":0.3599,"amount_avg5":14091722.0,"amount_avg20":18575258.0,"amount_avg60":20515947.1667,"obv_chg20":-4.5947,"turnover_20":1.8488,"pv_eff_20":-2.6797,"rsi14":42.07,"frgn_net_5":97.0,"inst_net_5":816.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0013,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0112,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0125,"frgn_net_20":-976.0,"inst_net_20":4782.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0134,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0655,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0521,"frgn_net_60":-56946.0,"inst_net_60":6964.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.7801,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0954,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.6847,"frgn_net_120":-71108.0,"inst_net_120":7284.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.9741,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0998,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.8743,"foreign_ratio":8.55,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.77,"smart_buy_streak":4,"op_income_q":26.0,"op_margin_q":4.4218,"op_qoq":30.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-55.1724,"rev_yoy":-9.119,"op_trend_4q":14.359,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.51,"debt_ratio":179.81,"per":3.8,"pbr":0.31,"div_